[0.478, "o", "lecture.mp4 — 00:00:18\r\nin job 'lecture'\r\n\r\n  00:00:05  It is a summary of what already happened, smoothed out.\r\n  00:00:08  People get into trouble when they treat it as a forecast.\r\n  00:00:11  [quiet] [nobody speaking · 7 seconds]\r\n> 00:00:18  Now, the crossover everyone talks about, here is what it actually tells you.\r\n  00:00:23  It tells you the short average has moved above the long one.\r\n  00:00:26  That is all it tells you.\r\n\r\nPicture: ~/VideoToLLM/lecture/1b7370e98f73438a887fdbc06af237a3_v1/frames/000009_t000018.jpg\r\n"]
